# This is the personal dotfiles repo → use the personal Claude account.
# `use claude ijcd` sets CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=~/.claude-ijcd (see
# ~/.config/direnv/lib/claude.sh). This .envrc is a LOCAL repo file — chezmoi
# does NOT deploy it (dot-prefixed source entries are ignored, plus it lives
# under the ignored .local/share and the deny-by-default top-level rule).
use claude ijcd
